</ul>
</div>
<div class="related-card">
<h4 id="h_01J3PTRBSREF78061G3EDYJG2J">Need more help?</h4>
<ul>
<li data-list-item-id="e3e8a31b18d7dd731effcbbba1dccd5d6">
<strong>To report fraudulent</strong> or unusual activity on your account, contact ANZ Customer Protection via <a href="https://www.anz.com/support/global-contacts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Global digital services support</a>.</li>
<li data-list-item-id="ed7d01d84c7ed46f6af0ccafea47f02e0"><a href="https://help.online.anz.com/hc/en-au/articles/13041136640153" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register for Webinars</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
